\begin{itemize}
\item Wikipedia article on the Suabo language: \url{https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suabo_language}
\item Omniglot page on Suabo (\emph{nid\'aibo}): \url{https://omniglot.com/writing/suabo.htm}
